{"id":"msg_m_ex_diesel_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_diesel","label":"Diesel · Nikke"},"label":"1. Wow, Commander!","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_ex_diesel_02","speakers":{"diesel":"Diesel"},"icons":{"diesel":"si_c072_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_1","text":"Wow, Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_2","text":"I heard that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_3","text":"we're going to be on a mission together this time! Hehehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_4","text":"I'm so happy!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_5","text":"I can't believe I can be with you everyday!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_6","text":"I'm happy too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_7","text":"I am","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_8","text":"very, very happy!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_9","text":"So, I went downtown today","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_10","text":"to buy some new strawberry candy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_11","text":"New strawberry candy?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_12","text":"That's right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_13","text":"Isn't it nice to find interest","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_14","text":"in something new?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_15","text":"So I think, for this exciting new journey","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_16","text":"that is about to begin,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_17","text":"I want to share my new strawberry candy with everyone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_18","text":"Do you have to?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_19","text":"What do you mean do I have to?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_20","text":"These little new things, when added together,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_21","text":"turn into excitement.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_22","text":"This kind of excitement will make you feel better!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_23","text":"So for me, the new strawberry candy","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_24","text":"are like these messages","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_25","text":"that I'm sending you right now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_26","text":"I'm super excited!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_27","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_28","text":"In that case,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_29","text":"I can help you buy some strawberry candies if you need them?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_30","text":"If I turn you down, will you listen and not buy any for me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_31","text":"Well... I'm not so sure about that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_32","text":"If you really don't like the things I give you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_33","text":"I might become upset and just not buy them for you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_34","text":"But I'm sure you won't say anything like that to me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_35","text":"right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_36","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_36","text":"Yes.","jump":"m_ex_diesel_01_38"},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_37","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_37","text":"No.","jump":"m_ex_diesel_01_42"},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_38","text":"Hehehe! Thanks, Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_39","text":"I was kind of worried there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_40","text":"I'm not sure what I'd do if you said no.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_41","text":"Now I can buy you strawberry candy with ease.","jump":"m_ex_diesel_01_46"},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_42","text":"It can't be! You're really mean to me today!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_43","text":"There's nothing I can do.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_44","text":"I'll have to use the strawberry candy to cure you of your","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_45","text":"mean attitude!","jump":"m_ex_diesel_01_46"},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_46","text":"So, you'll still buy me strawberry candy?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_47","text":"Yes, you got that right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_48","text":"I'll meet you later with my new strawberry candy!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_01_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_01_49","text":"Take care.","jump":null}],"chat":true}